la congolium sic ad nauseum. Souvlaki ignitus carborundum e pluribus unum. Defacto lingo est igpay atinlay. Marquee selectus non provisio incongruous feline nolo contendre. Gratuitous octopus niacin, sodium glutimate. Quote meon an estimate et non interruptus stadium.</td>\r\n								<td></td>\r\n							</tr>\r\n							<tr>\r\n								<td align=\"left\" valign=\"bottom\"><img src=\"images/corner03.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"10\" /></td>\r\n								<td width=\"99%\"></td>\r\n								<td align=\"right\" valign=\"bottom\"><img src=\"images/corner04.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"9\" height=\"10\" /></td>\r\n							</tr>\r\n						</table>\r\n					  </td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n				</table>\r\n			  </td>\r\n				<td width=\"30%\" align=\"left\" valign=\"top\">\r\n					<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\r\n						<tr>\r\n							<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\">\r\n								<table cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\r\n									<tr>\r\n										<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"type12txtbold\">Europan lingues</td>\r\n									</tr>\r\n									<tr>\r\n										<td class=\"type12rightpad01\" valign=\"top\"><img src=\"images/bullet02.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" /></td>\r\n										<td class=\"type12rightpad02\">Pro quo hic escorol.Defacto lingo</td>\r\n									</tr>							\r\n									<tr>\r\n										<td class=\"type12rightpad01\" valign=\"top\"><img src=\"images/bullet02.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" /></td>\r\n										<td class=\"type12rightpad02\">Epsum factorial non deposit quid pro quo hic escorol.</td>\r\n									</tr>\r\n									<tr>\r\n										<td class=\"type12rightpad01\" valign=\"top\"><img src=\"images/bullet02.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" /></td>\r\n										<td class=\"type12rightpad02\">Olypian quarrels et gorilla congolium sic ad nauseum.</td>\r\n									</tr>\r\n									<tr><td></td><td class=\"type12linedash\"><img src=\"images/spacer.gif\" alt=\"\" width